              "helpUri": "https://scout.docker.com/v/CVE-2025-61723?s=golang&n=stdlib&t=golang&vr=%3C1.24.8",
              "help": {
                "text": "The processing time for parsing some invalid inputs scales non-linearly with respect to the size of the input.\n\nThis affects programs which parse untrusted PEM inputs.\n",
                "markdown": "> The processing time for parsing some invalid inputs scales non-linearly with respect to the size of the input.\n\nThis affects programs which parse untrusted PEM inputs.\n\n|                                          |\n|Package         pkg:golang/stdlib@1.24.4  |\n|Affected range  <1.24.8                   |\n|Fixed version   1.24.8                    |\n"
