                "text": "When using LookupCNAME with the cgo DNS resolver, a very long CNAME response can trigger a double-free of C memory and a crash.\n",
                "markdown": "> When using LookupCNAME with the cgo DNS resolver, a very long CNAME response can trigger a double-free of C memory and a crash.\n\n|                                          |\n|Package         pkg:golang/stdlib@1.24.4  |\n|Affected range  <1.25.10                  |\n|Fixed version   1.25.10                   |\n"
